284
00:21:56.625 --> 00:21:57.708
Anyone up there?

285
00:21:57.791 --> 00:21:59.517
<i>Yeah,
this is Jeff in maintenance.</i>

286
00:21:59.541 --> 00:22:01.166
<i>You don't miss a thing, Commander.</i>

287
00:22:01.250 --> 00:22:03.416
