331
00:26:51.166 --> 00:26:52.750
<i>- We cannot...</i>
- Yes, I'm well aware.

332
00:26:53.875 --> 00:26:57.083
<i>Okay. Okay, let's take a deep breath.</i>

333
00:26:58.458 --> 00:26:59.916
