00:34:50.083 --> 00:34:51.625
Huh?

458
00:34:51.708 --> 00:34:53.250
We know what you did.

459
00:34:58.833 --> 00:35:00.666
Okay. Um...

460
00:35:02.250 --> 00:35:05.041
First of all, sorry.

461
00:35:06.208 --> 00:35:09.041
