in the arctic, and I...

480
00:35:50.291 --> 00:35:52.375
I found the location, and I walked.

481
00:35:52.458 --> 00:35:53.666
For who?

482
00:35:53.750 --> 00:35:55.041
I don't know.

483
00:35:55.125 --> 00:35:58.208
